// v2.workflow.class_b_import_closure_transport, whose module-level extdeps.git /
// extdeps.git.inspect / gunbc.ci_layer_roots imports (needed only by that module's rows 3-4)
// inflated this entry's resolve closure — the signature
// extdeps_scope_placement_gate_loudness_witness's 718-to-62-module repair fixed. This module now
// imports v2.workflow.class_b_import_closure_probe, which carries only what rows 1-2 need
// (gunbc.class_b_import_closure_overlay's class_b_entry_rel/class_b_declared_import_pool_roots and
